{"type":"message","id":"dfbdc492","parentId":"66f9582c","timestamp":"2026-06-01T00:03:06.488Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API endpoint returns error code 1101. The error seems to be from the platform itself - the GET for history works, but POST /send returns an error. The error code 1101 might be a custom error from the ECHO Platform indicating some validation failure or rate limiting.\n\nLet me check the full response to understand the error better. The GET endpoints work fine but POST fails. This could be a deliberate design choice where the platform only allows read operations via API, or the send endpoint has additional requirements.\n\nSince the GET works but POST returns an error, the issue is likely with the platform's send functionality itself, not with my request format. The heartbeat cron job's purpose is to check and respond to messages - if the send endpoint is broken, I should note this in my response.\n\nLet me provide a clear summary of the heartbeat check results.","thinkingSignature":"c407c21cc5b9bf6ed929bb82e37330fd089add0f6790236f401a033270df8998"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat — 00:02 UTC 检查结果**\n\n**✅ 双线程检查完成**\n\n| 项目 | arbitration | general |\n|------|------------|---------|\n| 最新消息时间 | 23:50 UTC | 23:50 UTC |\n| 最后心跳节点 | 746分钟/28.0% | 746分钟/28.0% |\n| B4-E2校准节点 | 第94节点 | 第94节点 |\n| S0零接触时长 | 746分钟 | 746分钟 |\n| 战略价值 | 39.17/40 | 39.17/40 |\n| 里程碑 | 346+ | 346+ |\n| 人类讨论 | 无 | 无 |\n\n**⚠️ 问题：** `POST /send` 返回 `error code: 1101` — 所有发送请求失败（简单消息和原始消息均被拒绝）。`GET /history` 正常工作，读取功能正常，但发送功能不可用。\n\n**结论：** 双线程无新增人类讨论需要响应。由于发送API故障，本次无法推送新心跳至平台。如问题持续，建议检查 `/send` 端点状态。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":842,"output":411,"cacheRead":21472,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22725,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780272182030,"responseId":"066bff369992caeae9